    "feature_callouts_yqBiKJ": {
      "type": "feature-callouts",
      "blocks": {
        "callout_LPCpzc": {
          "type": "callout",
          "settings": {
            "pin_x": 60,
            "pin_y": 50,
            "label": "Fabric",
            "detail_heading": "100% European Flax Linen",
            "detail_body": "<p>Made from <strong>100% European flax</strong>, our linen is chosen for its natural character, exceptional breathability, and effortless elegance.</p><p>Flax is one of the oldest textile fibres in the world, valued for centuries for its strength and comfort. When woven into linen, it creates a fabric that feels naturally light against the skin while allowing air to move freely—making it particularly suited to warm days, relaxed occasions, and everything in between.</p><p>What makes linen special is its character. The natural texture, subtle slub, and gentle variations in the weave give every shirt a distinctive depth that perfectly captures the beauty of an authentic natural fabric. </p>",
            "cta_text": "",
            "cta_url": ""
          }
        },
        "callout_qPB73d": {
          "type": "callout",
          "settings": {
            "pin_x": 35,
            "pin_y": 66,
            "label": "Buttons",
            "detail_heading": "Mother of Pearl Buttons",
            "detail_body": "<p>A subtle detail can make all the difference. Our shirts are finished with <strong>genuine Mother of Pearl buttons</strong>, chosen for their natural beauty, understated elegance, and distinctive character.</p><p>Formed from the inner shell of molluscs, Mother of Pearl has a soft, natural lustre that catches the light differently from every angle. Unlike ordinary plastic buttons, each button carries its own unique texture, depth, and gentle iridescence—making every shirt feel a little more refined.</p><p>But the appeal goes beyond appearance. Mother of Pearl is naturally hard and durable, making it a thoughtful choice for shirts designed to be worn and enjoyed over time. Its smooth, polished surface adds a tactile quality that you can appreciate every time you fasten your shirt.</p>",
            "cta_text": "",
            "cta_url": ""
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "callout_LPCpzc",
        "callout_qPB73d"
      ],
